Point copied leaf PointInfo at the copy's own dataset.

The tree copy kept each leaf's point pointer aimed at the source index's
data. After copying an index that owns its data (loaded with the dataset)
and freeing the source, searching the copy reads freed memory.

From https://github.com/seth-planet/flann/commit/91d30d6

